WEBVTT

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:15.250
♪ Aquarias are God's messengers ♪

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.958
♪ They have cut off their wings ♪

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:22.208
♪ They have cut off their wings ♪
"St. Angel Academy" "Girls Division"

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:22.958
♪ and pray for eternal serenity ♪
"St. Angel Academy" "Girls Division"

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:27.750
♪ and pray for eternal serenity ♪

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:33.000
♪ They divide one soul into two ♪

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.833
♪ Aquarias are God's messengers ♪

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:45.583
♪ They are cradles that hold us inside ♪

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:51.333
♪ We sleep in their wise arms ♪

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:58.042
♪ dreaming of eternal peace ♪

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:02.583
Around the time this song was created,
it was probably never expected

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:05.958
that Aquarias would stand
on the battlefield once again.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.625
Those Abductors come from beyond
the dimensional gate and attack us...

00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:13.125
They destroy cities and abduct people.

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:16.000
Their intention is still unknown.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.958
However, through many battles against them,

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.125
it's been concluded that
they're from another dimension

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:23.875
that has similar technologies to Earth.

00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:28.958
We, Neo-DEAVA, operate two Aquarias...

00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:35.458
Aquaria F-type, the noble splendor
that only chosen maidens can pilot...

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:38.708
...and the M-type that is only for men.

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:41.292
Abductors are our mysterious enemy.

00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:45.792
However, when we sky maidens
take each other's hands...

00:01:45.792 --> 00:01:47.792
--Zessica?
--Yes, ma'am.

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:53.250
You've experienced Aquaria's Gattai
four times during battle, right?

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:58.750
Please tell everyone the joy of
being chosen as a holy guardian.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.917
Hmm... let's see...

00:02:02.917 --> 00:02:04.833
Well, I think it feels good.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.500
Exactly.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.958
By dedicating your pure heart
to Aquaria, the supreme--

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:16.667
But it might be more exciting to
merge with guys instead of with girls.

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:18.500
What?!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.833
Oh, no...

00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:22.500
How shameless!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.833
The purity of the sky maidens
is protected by the Guize Stone!

00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:31.333
Having male and female Vectors
merge is absolutely forbidden!

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:34.500
--But...
--Aquarias are holy cradles.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.875
A fallen maiden who's come to know
the defilement of the opposite sex

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:38.667
will not be allowed to pilot them.

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:40.583
Exactly!

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:53.958
If God's messengers let out a fart...

00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:57.708
...we'll all go to hell! Bam! Bam!

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:01.375
Aquarias are our coffins!

00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:05.250
They wouldn't let us sleep even in the soil!

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.208
--Even so!
--Gattai!

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:09.208
--Just go!
--Gattai!

00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:11.167
--Smartly!
--Gattai!

00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:13.083
--Resolutely!
--Gattai!

00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:17.167
--Once our dream has come true,
--Hey! Shout louder from your gut!

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:20.167
--we’ll give up the ghost and go to hell!
--You guys, give it everything you've got!

00:03:20.167 --> 00:03:23.250
--Aquaria is our little devil...
--The last one will get a zapping from me!

00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:37.208
Tsk.

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:40.875
It's rare that you miss a target, Cayenne.

00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:42.375
Yeah, well...

00:03:42.375 --> 00:03:46.750
You've got that vision thing again?
What kind of prediction was it this time?

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.417
A wedding in mourning clothes.

00:03:48.417 --> 00:03:50.083
Mourning clothes?

00:03:50.083 --> 00:03:55.042
Dammit! If I had some ladies
cheering me on, like, "Andy! Go for it!"

00:03:55.042 --> 00:03:58.125
I could get more fired up.

00:03:58.125 --> 00:04:00.792
If only that Berlin Wall didn't exist...

00:04:00.792 --> 00:04:02.708
Andy, surely you aren't thinking

00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:05.917
about going to the other side
of the wall again, are you?

00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:07.958
No, sir, Instructor Donar!

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:11.875
If you start getting dirty ideas,
you'll get more than just a zapping.

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:16.875
--You'll get a noogie, too!
--Ooowww! Hey, you're already doing it!

00:04:19.042 --> 00:04:24.792
I thought I could merge with cute girls
all the time once I joined Neo-DEAVA.

00:04:24.792 --> 00:04:28.375
There are tons of girls close by,

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:31.750
and yet, to think that not only can I not
talk to them, I can't even see them...

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:37.250
Isn't this... Isn't this... a tragedy?!

00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:41.292
Abductors have appeared in the Crest Area.

00:04:41.292 --> 00:04:45.458
Elements are expected to take up
Class II Interception Positions.

00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:47.333
Here they come.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.667
Vector X is now taking off.

00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:15.458
Vector Y is now taking off!

00:05:16.917 --> 00:05:19.292
Vector Z is now taking off!

00:05:27.458 --> 00:05:28.958
<i>Reverence!</i>

00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:33.000
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:38.625
<i>I'll hold you over and over and over again</i>

00:05:38.625 --> 00:05:44.458
<i>I'll probably meet you tomorrow</i>

00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:50.167
<i>Relying on the dim starlight</i>

00:05:50.167 --> 00:05:56.250
<i>I'll recognize you, I know I will</i>

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:06.208
<i>After a hundred eons, the two of us</i>
<i>will open the door of legend</i>

00:06:06.208 --> 00:06:12.083
<i>Leaping over the blue abyss</i>

00:06:12.083 --> 00:06:17.875
<i>in order to live and die together with you</i>

00:06:17.875 --> 00:06:28.792
<i>I journeyed through many reincarnations</i>
<i>with sadness in my heart</i>

00:06:28.792 --> 00:06:31.833
<i>I'm at my full power and yet still incomplete</i>

00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:34.708
<i>Being by your side</i>

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:40.500
<i>brings warmth to my cold heart and with it, pain</i>

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.542
<i>But I'll always be by your side</i>

00:06:43.542 --> 00:06:46.458
<i>I'll always stay close to you</i>

00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:51.125
<i>The two of us will board the ship of light</i>

00:06:51.125 --> 00:06:56.917
<i>Let's play the wind's opening chords (Awaken!)</i>

00:07:02.042 --> 00:07:05.417
After ten thousand years
and two thousand more,

00:07:05.417 --> 00:07:10.833
the separated pieces of a soul gather here.

00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:13.125
A myth that holds an end...

00:07:13.125 --> 00:07:16.292
...is about to begin now.

00:07:19.792 --> 00:07:25.083
Sousei Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:32.667
Aquarion... Why does he
know that forbidden name?

00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:40.833
Oh...! No!

00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:42.333
What's with this Gattai?!

00:07:47.958 --> 00:07:50.167
It's all falling apart...!

00:07:50.167 --> 00:07:52.458
It's all falling apart and is about to burst out!

00:07:53.542 --> 00:07:57.000
Something I've cherished all this
time is going to burst out and...!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.875
My mind's going blank!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.375
Aquarion Evol!

00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:12.750
Aquarion, he said?

00:08:14.083 --> 00:08:16.500
My brain is boiling!

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:21.083
Worms are crawling through
my veins at an incredible pace!

00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:23.583
The source of this smell is...

00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:27.458
"Forbidden Gattai"

00:08:28.417 --> 00:08:30.667
Aquarion Evol, he said?!

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:32.708
The forbidden Aquarion...

00:08:32.708 --> 00:08:35.375
It merged with Vector Z as its head.

00:08:35.375 --> 00:08:38.167
To think that a different form of Aquaria exists!

00:08:38.167 --> 00:08:40.458
H-How filthy!

00:08:40.458 --> 00:08:42.375
Gattai between genders is
supposed to be forbidden!

00:08:42.375 --> 00:08:48.083
The seal has been broken... by those two.

00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:52.875
Amata, what's going on?
Are we inside an Aquaria?

00:08:52.875 --> 00:08:53.958
Yeah...

00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:54.958
What's Evol?

00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:56.417
Mikono, I'm...

00:08:56.417 --> 00:08:59.167
--Who are you, Amata?
--Mikono! Are you there?!

00:08:59.167 --> 00:09:00.417
Cayenne!

00:09:00.417 --> 00:09:03.250
Move away from that guy!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.042
Who are you?

00:09:05.042 --> 00:09:07.708
Are you a terrorist who's
trying to take over Aquaria?

00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:09.333
--Terrorist?!
--No way!

00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:10.792
Amata isn't someone like that!

00:09:10.792 --> 00:09:12.417
Don't waste your breath!

00:09:21.875 --> 00:09:24.792
A civilian couple is the head?! That's reckless!

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:27.625
Instructor! Please forcibly cancel
the Gattai from headquarters!

00:09:27.625 --> 00:09:29.958
We've been trying to! How is it working?!

00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:34.667
I-It's no good! It's not
accepting our control at all!

00:09:36.292 --> 00:09:38.625
So it's the same as that time after all...

00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:40.458
That time?

00:09:40.458 --> 00:09:45.083
Headmaster! I mean, Commander!
What on earth is Aquarion?!

00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:49.125
Different from the current Aquarias,
which are gender-specific,

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:54.125
it consists of both genders
and is a perfect form. But...

00:09:54.125 --> 00:09:57.833
But do you think that mankind
can handle God's instrument?

00:10:01.292 --> 00:10:04.708
What's with this guy?
So he just <i>looks </i>capable?

00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:08.042
Get serious and bring it on, you jerk!

00:10:13.667 --> 00:10:15.583
Mikono!

00:10:15.583 --> 00:10:17.333
Abductor...!

00:10:26.333 --> 00:10:27.833
What?!

00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:45.333
What was that?!

00:10:45.333 --> 00:10:48.542
The manual didn't say anything
about a weapon like that!

00:10:48.542 --> 00:10:50.167
I-Incredible...

00:10:50.167 --> 00:10:54.750
Who's that kid? Why is he
so in sync with Aquarion?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.208
H-Hm?

00:10:56.208 --> 00:10:57.542
Hey, you!

00:10:57.542 --> 00:10:59.000
How'd you do that attack?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.333
I don't know! It just moved on its own!

00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:05.292
--What?
--Could it be his instinct? Wow, how wild...!

00:11:05.292 --> 00:11:08.708
That's ridiculous! There's no way
that an amateur could do that!

00:11:08.708 --> 00:11:10.042
It's coming!

00:11:10.042 --> 00:11:12.708
I guess it can't be helped!
Since we can't cancel the Gattai,

00:11:12.708 --> 00:11:14.708
you, the head, need to fight!

00:11:14.708 --> 00:11:17.542
Head...? Fight...?

00:11:27.708 --> 00:11:29.542
What're you doing, you moron?!

00:11:29.542 --> 00:11:31.583
But I can't just...

00:11:37.083 --> 00:11:40.208
No... No!

00:11:40.208 --> 00:11:43.500
It's impossible to fight! Let's stop this now.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.708
Since we were able to get in,
we should be able to get out, right?!

00:11:46.708 --> 00:11:49.500
Hey, girl! How can you
say that at a time like this?!

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:53.583
Amata! Let's run! We're both incapable!

00:11:53.583 --> 00:11:55.125
Shut up, Mikono!

00:11:55.125 --> 00:11:56.667
Mikono...

00:12:02.458 --> 00:12:03.792
The enemy sent in reinforcements!

00:12:03.792 --> 00:12:05.083
They're not small fries.

00:12:05.083 --> 00:12:07.667
They're large models! Three of the same type!

00:12:09.792 --> 00:12:11.542
What are you guys doing here?

00:12:13.583 --> 00:12:16.625
Sir Kagura. You're hereby ordered to return.

00:12:16.625 --> 00:12:19.333
Please come back to Altair with us.

00:12:19.333 --> 00:12:21.833
Did old man Izumo put you up to this?

00:12:21.833 --> 00:12:24.625
We've completed our collection of Rare Iguras.

00:12:24.625 --> 00:12:27.292
Further fighting is meaningless.

00:12:27.292 --> 00:12:30.042
I'm the one who decides
the meaning of fighting!

00:12:35.125 --> 00:12:37.125
Dammit! We, too...

00:12:37.125 --> 00:12:39.125
We're not gonna let you keep beating us!

00:12:40.292 --> 00:12:43.875
Listen! I'll teach you how to fight!

00:12:43.875 --> 00:12:47.542
--Okay!
--Unlock the lever... like this!

00:12:52.792 --> 00:12:54.292
What?!

00:13:01.833 --> 00:13:03.333
No way...!

00:13:04.417 --> 00:13:08.167
Zessica's Element power has
been immeasurably strengthened.

00:13:08.167 --> 00:13:11.333
Is it resonating with that boy?

00:13:11.333 --> 00:13:13.667
So this is the Gattai among
Vectors of both genders...

00:13:13.667 --> 00:13:17.750
It's different... Everything is
different from the Aquarias we know.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.750
Forbidden power...

00:13:23.875 --> 00:13:25.375
S-Sir Kagura!

00:13:25.375 --> 00:13:28.875
You bastards! Did you come
to cause me trouble?!

00:13:28.875 --> 00:13:30.333
Wh-What're you...?

00:13:30.333 --> 00:13:32.625
You no longer need this, do you?!

00:13:32.625 --> 00:13:34.167
Please stop it!

00:13:36.625 --> 00:13:39.708
They're fighting among
themselves? What's he doing?

00:13:43.833 --> 00:13:45.833
--What?!
--What's with him?!

00:13:49.917 --> 00:13:53.042
I can smell it... I can smell it.

00:13:53.042 --> 00:13:57.083
I'll bite into... the source of this smell.

00:14:10.167 --> 00:14:13.167
H-He forcibly attached a piece
from another Abductor to his own.

00:14:13.167 --> 00:14:15.375
And he can still move like that...?!

00:14:15.375 --> 00:14:17.417
It's a beast and monster at the same time!

00:14:17.417 --> 00:14:18.958
I can't stand it anymore!

00:14:18.958 --> 00:14:20.375
Mikono...

00:14:20.375 --> 00:14:23.708
I can't stand this! I can't...

00:14:23.708 --> 00:14:27.167
What's with this girl?! All she does is cry!

00:14:27.167 --> 00:14:30.333
We're in the middle of a battle!
Don't lose control of yourself, Mikono!

00:14:32.167 --> 00:14:34.917
Mikono is a girl...

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.792
Can I protect her?

00:14:38.792 --> 00:14:40.292
Mikono!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.292
Wh-What's this? A funeral procession?

00:14:53.792 --> 00:14:57.542
A wedding in mourning clothes...
This is the nightmare I had!

00:14:57.542 --> 00:14:59.625
A-A wedding?

00:14:59.625 --> 00:15:02.583
An Element power, Despair Prediction...

00:15:02.583 --> 00:15:06.375
It gives him visions of ill-omened events
that are to happen in the future.

00:15:06.375 --> 00:15:09.667
Why are we able to see that vision?

00:15:09.667 --> 00:15:16.000
It's Aquarion... Aquarion, who took the
forbidden name back, is showing it to us.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:19.458
So the prediction was
referring to this situation...

00:15:19.458 --> 00:15:23.042
The desperate... worst Gattai!

00:15:25.083 --> 00:15:26.625
--Mikono!
--Me?!

00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:28.125
Why me?

00:15:28.125 --> 00:15:31.208
Who's the guy?! Show me your face!

00:15:36.417 --> 00:15:37.917
Who's that?

00:15:47.875 --> 00:15:49.750
S-Sir Kagura!

00:15:52.875 --> 00:15:54.750
You're in there, aren't you?

00:15:57.042 --> 00:16:00.417
The main cause of that smell...
It's a damn woman!

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.625
She's mine!

00:16:06.833 --> 00:16:08.333
Run!

00:16:26.583 --> 00:16:28.875
It's your fault, you brat!

00:16:30.333 --> 00:16:34.125
You caused such a reckless Gattai!
On top of that, you dragged Mikono into it!

00:16:34.125 --> 00:16:35.708
It's all your fault!

00:16:35.708 --> 00:16:39.458
Right. It's my fault.

00:16:39.458 --> 00:16:43.917
When my heart goes pitter-patter, I float.

00:16:45.208 --> 00:16:49.833
Since my childhood,
I've always creeped everyone out.

00:16:51.417 --> 00:16:56.542
She left me because of this power, too.

00:16:56.542 --> 00:17:01.042
So I was never going to use my power again.

00:17:01.042 --> 00:17:04.958
But I wanted to protect you, Mikono...

00:17:04.958 --> 00:17:06.458
And yet...

00:17:08.167 --> 00:17:11.333
I dragged you into more trouble.

00:17:18.208 --> 00:17:23.417
When there was no way
that I could protect you...

00:17:24.542 --> 00:17:26.042
Amata...

00:17:28.375 --> 00:17:30.958
Come out, you damn woman!

00:17:31.542 --> 00:17:32.125
"Danger"

00:17:32.333 --> 00:17:34.167
The shield level decreased!

00:17:34.167 --> 00:17:36.042
If nothing is done, Aquarion will be...

00:17:37.333 --> 00:17:40.333
Being accepted by the myth...

00:17:40.333 --> 00:17:43.792
...means you yourself become the myth.

00:17:43.792 --> 00:17:47.708
Amata Sora. Are you prepared for that?

00:17:52.125 --> 00:17:53.625
I'm sorry.

00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:59.875
I lumped you in with me by saying
that we were both incapable.

00:17:59.875 --> 00:18:01.792
You're amazing, Amata.

00:18:01.792 --> 00:18:06.458
We just met, and yet you're
trying to protect me...

00:18:06.458 --> 00:18:10.292
...even though I'm a coward
who keeps whining.

00:18:10.292 --> 00:18:11.792
Mikono...

00:18:17.125 --> 00:18:20.250
Thank you... I'm sorry...

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.792
Thank you...

00:18:29.208 --> 00:18:37.333
Mikono's hand is small...
smooth... warm, and...

00:18:37.333 --> 00:18:40.208
--Huh?
--...soft!

00:18:42.417 --> 00:18:44.708
--What?
--What the hell...?

00:19:11.667 --> 00:19:15.583
--I can't believe it!
--Aquarion... is flying!

00:19:15.583 --> 00:19:20.042
That acceleration...
isn't just by Aquarion's power.

00:19:20.042 --> 00:19:22.625
It'll reach satellite orbit soon!

00:19:22.625 --> 00:19:26.292
Could it possibly be...
that boy's Element power?!

00:19:53.167 --> 00:19:55.333
Incredible...

00:19:55.333 --> 00:19:56.833
Did we do it?

00:20:01.792 --> 00:20:03.792
How dare you?!

00:20:09.417 --> 00:20:11.042
A dimensional gate...!

00:20:12.833 --> 00:20:15.917
Kagura, unfortunately,
you're running out of time.

00:20:15.917 --> 00:20:18.000
Izumo! I can still...

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:21.500
...fight? That's a joke.

00:20:22.583 --> 00:20:26.125
A beaten dog should return to his doghouse.

00:20:26.125 --> 00:20:27.625
Got that?

00:20:36.208 --> 00:20:39.875
--Hey!
--Amata?! Amata?!

00:21:00.083 --> 00:21:01.583
Cayenne...

00:21:14.042 --> 00:21:16.583
--Oh, boy...
--Amata!

00:21:16.583 --> 00:21:19.875
Such a wimpy guy...

00:21:19.875 --> 00:21:21.333
Cayenne, Zessica.

00:21:21.333 --> 00:21:24.250
Return with that brat and the girl.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:29.583
Roger, as far as the guy is concerned.
But there's no value in this girl.

00:21:29.583 --> 00:21:35.000
We can't readily let someone who got
in Aquarion without permission go home.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.500
Roger.

00:21:41.958 --> 00:21:44.958
I finally found...

00:21:46.042 --> 00:21:50.000
...the only girl who'll wait for me.

00:22:03.625 --> 00:22:06.750
The power that flying boy exhibited...

00:22:08.292 --> 00:22:09.833
Can't be, right...?

00:22:16.875 --> 00:22:19.500
The noisy guy is back.

00:22:31.042 --> 00:22:34.833
--Jin...
--To see you damaged a Gnis that much...

00:22:34.833 --> 00:22:36.792
So did anything good come of it?

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:40.208
I found her!

00:22:40.208 --> 00:22:41.708
Huh?

00:22:46.083 --> 00:22:48.375
I found a damn woman just for me.

00:22:52.583 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>It wasn't stolen away by the wind</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:00.917
<i>With the resolve that we cannot turn back,</i>

00:23:00.917 --> 00:23:08.708
<i>we accept the tragedy</i>

00:23:08.708 --> 00:23:13.417
<i>A cavern lies where my heart once was</i>

00:23:13.417 --> 00:23:16.000
<i>If I was older,</i>

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.667
<i>would I have been able</i>
<i>to save you and the future?</i>

00:23:21.667 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Having only a single means</i>
<i>to protect the one you love,</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:35.833
<i>you become lost and drift in the sky</i>

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:43.542
<i>I'll never be able to meet anyone</i>
<i>who means more to me than you</i>

00:23:43.542 --> 00:23:50.000
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:56.542
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:23:56.542 --> 00:24:02.500
<i>A melody that seals away</i>
<i>the vulnerable tenderness</i>

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.542
<i>The more I play it, the more I sing it...</i>

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:11.042
<i>It almost destroys me how much...</i>

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:17.958
<i>...I long for you</i>

00:24:20.167 --> 00:24:23.833
It seems that Gattai is a
very difficult thing to do.

00:24:23.833 --> 00:24:28.583
So it's okay if you're not
that good at it at first.

00:24:30.167 --> 00:24:30.792
"Next Episode 'Love Index Skyrockets'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:30.792 --> 00:24:33.000
"Next Episode 'Love Index Skyrockets'"
"Love Index Skyrockets."
